WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.920
What is the difference between transparent and translucent?

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:10.210
Transparent: you see clearly through it, like clear glass.

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:16.550
Translucent: light gets through, but blurry, like frosted glass.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:21.013
Opaque: no light at all, like wood.
